# Product module trim for liuqin (Ubuntu tablet, SM8475).  Drops modules that
# cannot exist on this product or serve no desktop use: other SoC platforms,
# wired Ethernet MACs, PCIe/SDIO non-Qualcomm WiFi, other GPUs/panels/bridges,
# platform media capture/codec, third-party ASoC codecs/machines, IR keymaps,
# and CAN/NFC stacks whose USB adapters are not enabled anyway.  USB
# peripherals, filesystems, crypto/dm, netfilter/sched, Qualcomm audio/video/
# connectivity (ath11k/ath12k, venus), virtio (QEMU tests), IIO and everything
# referenced by the board DTS stay.  Release module set: 1342 -> ~476.
# liuqin (Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro, SM8475) module trim candidate list
# merge_config fragment; every symbol below is =m in the current product .config
# generated: see /tmp/liuqin-trim-report.md for evidence and verification
# modules: 1342 -> 476 (-866, 64.5%); symbols listed: 709

